    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Taito's Darius series began with the titular arcade game, Darius, in 1986 and comprises numerous side-scrolling shooting games released in arcades, many of which were later ported to game consoles.<br>G-Darius is the 4th arcade game in the Darius series of horizontally-scrolling shooting games, which sees the Silver Hawks battling against huge, space-faring warships who resemble various aquatic life-forms. <br>G-Darius HD features 5 versions of G-Darius: arcade-perfect ports of G-Darius and G-Darius Ver.2 and an HD version of each, along with the console port of G-Darius, coupled with an Steam-exclusive widescreen bonus mode!<br><br><strong>G-Darius/G-Darius HD</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/7422840f11e7a77973e678a5914a83ad.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/414cae4320ee4b4188328189e75230a7.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br>The original arcade game, faithfully recreated with a host of extra features to enhance your enjoyment! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use the Capture Ball!<br>Capture most enemies and turn them against their allies.<br></li><li>Fire the \u03b1 Beam!<br>Release captured enemies in an all-powerful burst of destructive energy.<br></li><li>Boss Beam Battles!<br>Counter a boss's \u03b2 Beam with your own \u03b1 Beam to unleash an even more deadly Counter Beam.<br></li><li>Branching paths!<br>Choose your route as Zones branch midway and after each boss.<br></li><li>Capture Gallery!<br>Check which enemies you still need to capture.<br></li><li>Subwoofer compatible! (Steam only)<br>Re-create the legendary in-seat speaker of the arcade cabinet.<br></li><li>Gadgets galore!<br>Dive deeper into the game with extra info to aid you in your battle.</li></ul><br><strong>G-Darius Ver.2/G-Darius Ver.2 HD</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/93da74be51f78872549b75a368ed1d2b.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/7e3862d6d35fe9c6a6ce393fbdad66bf.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br>All the features of G-Darius and more, in this update to the original arcade game!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beginner mode<br></li><li>Rapid fire button added<br></li><li>Game speed adjustments<br></li><li>Enemy endurance adjustments<br></li><li>Player shield capacity adjustments<br></li><li>Mid-bosses added to some zones<br></li><li>Boss timer &amp; timer bonus system<br></li><li>New and adjusted boss attack patterns</li></ul><br><strong>G-Darius CS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/dfa8f1bc221ab8cfeeee2e0012d41b25.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br>A faithfully emulated console port with all the extra features which that release boasted! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight any or all of the 30 bosses in VS BOSS mode!<br></li><li>Practice your skills using the beginner\u2019s mode.<br></li><li>View the opening and endings from the options menu.</li></ul>Note: this is the Japanese version of the game features no gadgets or enhancements from the other versions included here.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/a2172409b0faf481435633c9f37eac86.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br><strong>Exhibition</strong><br>Peek at what might have been if G-Darius was developed as a dual screen arcade cabinet! Battle a handful of selected bosses in wide-screen glory in this PC-exclusive bonus mode!",
    "about_the_game": "Taito's Darius series began with the titular arcade game, Darius, in 1986 and comprises numerous side-scrolling shooting games released in arcades, many of which were later ported to game consoles.<br>G-Darius is the 4th arcade game in the Darius series of horizontally-scrolling shooting games, which sees the Silver Hawks battling against huge, space-faring warships who resemble various aquatic life-forms. <br>G-Darius HD features 5 versions of G-Darius: arcade-perfect ports of G-Darius and G-Darius Ver.2 and an HD version of each, along with the console port of G-Darius, coupled with an Steam-exclusive widescreen bonus mode!<br><br><strong>G-Darius/G-Darius HD</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/7422840f11e7a77973e678a5914a83ad.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/414cae4320ee4b4188328189e75230a7.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br>The original arcade game, faithfully recreated with a host of extra features to enhance your enjoyment! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use the Capture Ball!<br>Capture most enemies and turn them against their allies.<br></li><li>Fire the \u03b1 Beam!<br>Release captured enemies in an all-powerful burst of destructive energy.<br></li><li>Boss Beam Battles!<br>Counter a boss's \u03b2 Beam with your own \u03b1 Beam to unleash an even more deadly Counter Beam.<br></li><li>Branching paths!<br>Choose your route as Zones branch midway and after each boss.<br></li><li>Capture Gallery!<br>Check which enemies you still need to capture.<br></li><li>Subwoofer compatible! (Steam only)<br>Re-create the legendary in-seat speaker of the arcade cabinet.<br></li><li>Gadgets galore!<br>Dive deeper into the game with extra info to aid you in your battle.</li></ul><br><strong>G-Darius Ver.2/G-Darius Ver.2 HD</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/93da74be51f78872549b75a368ed1d2b.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/7e3862d6d35fe9c6a6ce393fbdad66bf.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br>All the features of G-Darius and more, in this update to the original arcade game!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beginner mode<br></li><li>Rapid fire button added<br></li><li>Game speed adjustments<br></li><li>Enemy endurance adjustments<br></li><li>Player shield capacity adjustments<br></li><li>Mid-bosses added to some zones<br></li><li>Boss timer &amp; timer bonus system<br></li><li>New and adjusted boss attack patterns</li></ul><br><strong>G-Darius CS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/dfa8f1bc221ab8cfeeee2e0012d41b25.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br>A faithfully emulated console port with all the extra features which that release boasted! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight any or all of the 30 bosses in VS BOSS mode!<br></li><li>Practice your skills using the beginner\u2019s mode.<br></li><li>View the opening and endings from the options menu.</li></ul>Note: this is the Japanese version of the game features no gadgets or enhancements from the other versions included here.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640160/extras/a2172409b0faf481435633c9f37eac86.avif?t=1738644003\" /></div><br><strong>Exhibition</strong><br>Peek at what might have been if G-Darius was developed as a dual screen arcade cabinet! Battle a handful of selected bosses in wide-screen glory in this PC-exclusive bonus mode!",
